ogists count **duties**. **Such was** the pull of the debate **that** the symposium **adjourned** early. **It was the ideas**, **not the speakers**, **that** lasted."],"kicker":"REPORT","by":"Philosophy Circle","gloss":[["go through","ser aceito, passar"],["persuade","persuadir"],["whereas","ao passo que"],["adjourn","suspender"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Persuading someone is the same as convincing them.","ans":"F","why":"what matters is the difference."},{"q":"Consequentialists count outcomes.","ans":"T","why":"count outcomes."},{"q":"The speakers lasted longer than the ideas.","ans":"F","why":"It was the ideas that lasted."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“persuade someone to” = ?","opts":["levar alguém a agir","mudar a crença","pedir ajuda"],"ans":0,"why":"persuade to."},{"q":"“whereas” = ?","opts":["ao passo que","embora","porque"],"ans":0,"why":"whereas."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Grammar recap","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Verifique","Exemplo"],"rows":[["**convince × persuade**","convince **that**; persuade **to**"],["**Inversão**","**Not until** X **did**…; **Hardly had**… **when**"],["**Cleft**","**It was** X **that**…; **What** I need **is**…"],["**go**","go wrong · go through · go on"],["**Argumento**","**given that** · **therefore** · **one might object**"]],"cap":"Lista de verificação da Unidade 8 (C2)"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice · Mixed review","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences (from the unit)","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"She wants to ___ him that the timeline is impossible. (convince)","a":"convince","why":"crença."},{"s":"We ___ the mayor to retract his remarks. (urge)","a":"urge","why":"exortação."},{"s":"The model ___ that persuasion follows two routes. (hold)","a":"holds","why":"verbo de teoria."},{"s":"Consequentialists judge by ___. (outcomes)","a":"outcomes","why":"vocabulário."},{"s":"Plato asks us to ___ prisoners chained in a cave. (imagine)","a":"imagine","why":"convite."},{"s":"Not until the final session ___ delegates address the question. (do, passado)","a":"did","why":"inversão."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["witness timeline","cronologia da testemunha"],["reasonable doubt","dúvida razoável"],["not-guilty vote","voto de inocente"],["guilty verdict","veredito de culpado"],["deliberating jurors","jurados deliberando"],["jury room","sala do júri"]]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Unit word bank","blocks":[{"type":"words","items":[["jury room","sala do júri"],["deliberating jurors","jurados deliberando"],["guilty verdict","veredito de culpado"],["not-guilty vote","voto de inocente"],["reasonable doubt","dúvida razoável"],["witness timeline","cronologia da testemunha"],["shutting-up hour","hora de fechar"],["alibi window","janela do álibi"],["testimony transcript","transcrição de depoimento"],["read-back request","pedido de leitura dos autos"],["unanimous verdict","veredito unânime"],["hung jury","júri dividido"],["holdout juror","jurado dissidente"],["hunch-based vote","voto baseado em palpite"],["burden of conviction","ônus da condenação"],["cross-checked time","horário conferido"],["changed vote","voto mudado"],["night deliberation","deliberação noturna"],["shop closure","fechamento da loja"],["onlooker’s version","versão de quem viu"],["memory lapse","lapso de memória"],["logical impossibility","impossibilidade lógica"],["rational appeal","apelo racional"],["tearful entreaty","súplica emocionada"],["civic language","linguagem cívica"],["shared resource","recurso compartilhado"],["campaign etiquette pact","pacto de etiqueta de campanha"],["campaign rhetoric","retórica de campanha"],["heated remark","comentário inflamado"],["dehumanising label","rótulo desumanizador"],["insulting epithet","epíteto ofensivo"],["political vermin","tratamento de \"pragas\" políticas"],["traitor slur","insulto de traidor"],["w